eirs-second-order.conf - the corticothalamic model on a 4x4 grid with the
optional second-order time-stepping scheme (Integration SecondOrder). It covers
Wave and Harmonic propagators, Map propagators, both dendrite types (RK4 for
the cortex, Integral for the thalamus) and delays that are not whole numbers
of time-steps (0.3 ms intracortical and 42 ms corticothalamic, which this
scheme interpolates instead of rounding). The input is a constant drive plus
a smooth (sigmoidal) pulse at node 6, so the output is deterministic.

